Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Enhanced patrols, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:07.60,Default,,450,0,450,,{\b1\i1}Beyond \N Good and Evil{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:16.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, is there any new testimony\Nfrom the remaining assault team members?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing too enlightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:23.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All we know is that they reported to Chief\NNiimi, who recently committed cyberbrain suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:26.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We haven't made any further\Nprogress on that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:29.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Furthermore, the Laughing Man, who is\Ncrucial to our case, is nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From now on, we will follow the Chief's orders
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:35.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and go after this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:42.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. Councilman Yakushima Kaoru, the current\NSecretary General for the ruling coalition party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.92,0:02:47.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Secretary General Yakushima is said\Nto be the number one power broker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was the Minister of Health and Welfare\Nwhen the first Laughing Man incident occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He secured his current position of power by\Ntransferring jurisdiction over cybernetic technology
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,from the Ministry of International Trade and Industry\Nto the Ministry of Health and Welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's a hardcore health and welfare faction member.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition, while this is not widely known,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he has strong ties with the MSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:05.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then that would explain where\Nthat armour suit came from, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what the Chief seems to think, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:12.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In truth, the connections between the\NMSDF and politics were established
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,when Yakushima, a former MSDF admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:18.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,entered politics with substantial funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At that time, a MSDF accounting\Nofficial indicted Yakushima
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:25.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,of misappropriating secret funds for his own use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the prosecutor in charge of\Nthe case was found run over by a train
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the investigation was halted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:36.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The case remained unsolved and the\Ncharges against Yakushima were dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Daidou, the retired Police Commissioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:44.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was Yakushima's underclassman at\Nthe National Defence Academy and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:51.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu was one of Yakushima's closest\Ngolf acquaintances since his days as a medic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:53.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you sure you should be up and about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't be resting at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:04:00.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So in other words, he has enough political backing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:04.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to have been the person pulling the strings\Nbehind the scenes in all of these cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, although there is no proof at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:11.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How do you intend to go after a\NSecretary General who is still in office?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:16.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will investigate the last remaining connection between\NSecretary General Yakushima and the Laughing Man Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,SERANO Genomix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. The deliberate rejection of the Murai Vaccine, which\Nis thought to have instigated the Laughing Man Case,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:29.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the concurrent acceptance of\NSerano's micromachine treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:34.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we take custody of Ernest SERANO, who is thought\Nto have been deeply involved in both of these events,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:36.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and immediately conduct an interrogation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then we should be able to gain insight into the\Nconnection between Yakushima and the Laughing Man case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. SERANO has been under house arrest\Nfor these six years since the incident
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:44.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,under the pretext of personal protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:48.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Place him under custody without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:51.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Laughing Man must have the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we happen to run into each other, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Place him under custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:05:00.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,for in a sense, he is the single\Nmost important witness in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:03.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the possibility\Nthat SERANO will be eliminated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:05.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,as a result of our taking action yet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is of course possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why you must succeed\Nno matter what the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:29.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. President, you have an incoming\Ntransmission from the Netherlands branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What would you like me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:35.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please tell him that I will contact\Nhim after I arrive in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:36.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:40.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I apologise for always making\Nyou act like my secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:45.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even so, you are the most competent detective
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,out of all the ones who\Nhave been with me thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:51.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about actually becoming my secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll pay you a comfortable salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:54.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you for the kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that your ride has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:59.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:02.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will be there shortly to escort\Nyou, so please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:06.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm slightly nervous now that security\Nhas been upped by another notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:09.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no need for you to be concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:41.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From the time I saw the news about the\NSunflower Society and Imakurusu on TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was prepared for the fact\Nthat you would come here next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:49.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came here to have you fulfil the\Npromise you made to me six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you please come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:58.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Subject has exited his quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:02.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is heading towards the entrance hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:09.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Open the entrance doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:19.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please be careful, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:20.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Subject has exited the entrance hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Confirmed exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's the same thing that\Nhappened the last time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:49.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, the only difference this time is that there were\Ndetectives in the hallways instead of your family members.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There were no cars following us, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sir, please turn left at the next light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:07.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't let them out of your sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:19.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With this, we have approximately\None hour before the unmarked
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,patrol car arrives at the\Nmain SERANO Genomix branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:24.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please tell me the reasons why\Nyou did not keep the promise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you made to me and instead,\Nkept your silence for six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:30.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have to decide on our plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:33.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How audacious of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.55,Default - Copy,,0,350,650,,{\b1\i1}BUS STOP{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:46.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put both hands on top of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We are from Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We contacted you in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:55.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it true that Mr. SERANO\Nhas already left the premises?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:59.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As usual, he left in his car. What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:00.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Check the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that "as usual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:07.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What a diligent president.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:11.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You idiots all had your eyes stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:19.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mr. SERANO was alone even when I\Ntold him that his car had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:25.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The security camera system's AI has been hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:28.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Medusa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:29.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hand over your ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:30.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.59,Default - Copy,,0,0,450,,{\b1\i1}Shinhama Prefectural Police \N  Ishizawa Naoyuki \N SECTION 1{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:42.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sheesh, you guys are all softies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are interceptors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:49.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To think that you guys are\Nstill rigged with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:55.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Interceptors utilise a transmission device\Nwithin the cyberbrain when they relay data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You would have occasionally felt\Na heavy system load at those times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:09.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While your cyberbrains recorded\Nthat only Mr. SERANO passed by,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:13.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the interceptors clearly show the Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:16.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the truth behind the\Nkidnapping six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:23.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, dive into all the IR Systems within a\Nthree kilometre radius of the SERANO residence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:25.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and search for Mr. Serano's vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:28.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Laughing Man has kidnapped Mr. SERANO again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Find him, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:31.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:35.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, there is no guarantee that\Nthe car will be on the IR system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:35.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've been listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll run a complete search.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Factor in the possibility that\Nthe AIs have been overwritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:42.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:11:00.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Loiter around for about thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have a personal matter to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:17.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The view from here has certainly changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,SERANO-San, you're starting\Nto get grey hairs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These six years have been harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While the pretext was to protect me\Nfrom receiving further threats from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:33.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,in actuality, it was to keep an eye on me to ensure that\NI would not reveal the truth behind the kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:35.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For all intents and purposes, it was house arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:40.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As for you, you seem to have lost\Nthe naivete of six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Perhaps I have gained somewhat in maturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:48.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the time, I was naive enough to really think about\Nstriking down all the injustices in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though you say that now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:54.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you were a pretty passionate man\Nyourself, SERANO-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:12:00.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, even though your cyberbrain was infiltrated,\Nyou kept company with an anonymous student,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.23,0:12:02.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who hacked into your\Ncyberbrain, for two whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:05.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Back then, I had enough energy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:09.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to try and use logic to defeat\Na student who spouted naivete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.49,Default - Copy,,0,950,750,,{\b1\i1}2024 Japan International Expo \N  Awaji Expo\N 100 Days Until Opening{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand your point,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:18.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I'm a developer of a micromachine company,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.49,0:12:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,not a member of the Drug Evaluation Committee!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:23.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not involved with the rejection\Nof the Murai Vaccine in any way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:27.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the Drug Evaluation Committee\Nis a group of liars who are full of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:31.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will probably have to\Nchallenge that group, but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:36.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would like for you to publicize the fact that your company's\Nmicromachines have nearly no effect on cyberbrain sclerosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:40.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I've repeatedly told you\Nbefore, that is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:44.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As was written in an e-mail\Nthreat three years earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:49.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the micromachine treatment was only\Na theoretical idea at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:51.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But patents are like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:57.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is in no way illegal to preemptively patent a\Ntechnology that one will attain with certainty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:13:01.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what all the shitty lawyers say! Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I do realise that my request\Nfor approval was premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:10.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was also a bluff aimed towards my competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:16.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, I believe that the treatment exceeded our expectations\Nand was approved by the Evaluation Committee after three months
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,because our theories were admittedly superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:28.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have no idea how much damage there will be now\Nif we undermine faith in medical micromachines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:31.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For the technology to substantially\Ndevelop in the years to come-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What I wish to say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:37.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,is that it is a matter of life and death for\Nthose who are suffering from cyberbrain sclerosis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:41.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Couldn't you at least allow the\NMurai Vaccine to have a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:44.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,until micromachine treatment is\Nseen to have concrete effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:48.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is nothing I can do\Nregarding the Murai Vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:49.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you really sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:55.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If God felt whimsical and\Ngave you cyberbrain sclerosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:58.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then would you choose micromachine\Ntreatment without hesitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:13:59.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:03.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have pride and full confidence\Nin what I have created.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:06.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, what if your child became\Ninflicted with cyberbrain sclerosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:09.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes... it would be the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:12.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I cannot entertain hypothetical scenarios any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:17.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pride and sentiments are different\Nthings, aren't they...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're being unfair, SERANO-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:22.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you have that much pride\Nin micromachine treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:26.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then you should use your\Nposition and enact justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:32.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu only thought about rejecting the vaccine,\Nwhich had Dr. Murai's name attached to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:36.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Evaluation Committee is a shit organisation\Nthat was originally intended to just
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:39.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,stamp approval on new drugs that made it\Nthrough the Ministry of Health and Welfare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:42.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Imakurusu, who became the Committee's director,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:47.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,went through the trouble of making a stamp for\Nrejection just to destroy the Murai Vaccine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:51.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,your micromachines were\Nused in that ugly conflict!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:56.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even you can't claim complete ignorance\Nabout the circumstances involved, SERANO-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:15:00.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It didn't matter to them whether\Nit was {\i1}your{\i} micromachines or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:05.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As long as the approval had been requested at that\Ntime, it could have been any shit micromachine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fully aware that the health\Nindustry is full of shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:11.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,can you still say that it doesn't\Nhave anything to do with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fine, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, release me and let me be free again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Afterward, I will gather the media\Nas soon as preparations are complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:26.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and announce the true status of\Nmicromachine treatment as of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is a promise that would\Nnot benefit you in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not that stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:39.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although not to the same extent as you, I believe\NI do have a certain sense of social justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:40.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:52.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the time, I was weary\Nfrom cyberbrain infiltration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:55.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I made the promise out of\Ndesperation; just to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:59.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I also thought that you would\Nnot make any further rash moves
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,once we were under public scrutiny\Nin front of the TV cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:09.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes... unfortunately, however,\Nthere was a S&W Chief's Special in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:13.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you release me from cyberbrain infiltration?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:18.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You must know that this is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:21.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you wish to hide your face\Nand maintain your anonymity,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then it wouldn't be a good\Nidea to appear on TV, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:32.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was fun debating with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:37.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But as one who must protect his company,\NI may not be able to keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:40.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Society is not as simplistic as you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will not try to find out who you are, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, let's part our ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:53.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is unfair of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:22.76,Default - Copy,,1400,0,850,,{\b1\i1}This Morning's \N Weather{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:06.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now tell the truth in front of the cameras!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop this. You aren't capable of shooting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, do you think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:27.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Afterward, when I was taken into\Nprotective custody by the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:32.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,my executive manager told me that my two days with you\Nhad developed into a serious kidnapping incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,which was causing a stir amongst the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:39.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Also, the moment after I left my home with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:44.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a massive ransom demand had\Nalready been made to the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:50.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, I couldn't bring myself to\Nbelieve that you had made such a demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:54.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were indeed a hacking genius and a criminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:58.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but it seemed to me that you only\Nused your talents to confront all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:02.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the injustices in this world with\Nyour youthful sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:07.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the police decided that you\Nwere a kidnapper after ransom money
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:12.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and repeatedly interrogated me as to whether\NI had any idea regarding your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:18.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In spite of that, the managing executive and I\Ndecided to maintain that we had no idea whatsoever
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:23.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,because we could not afford to have the inadequacies\Nof our company's micromachines questioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:25.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was as you said;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.05,0:18:29.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was painfully reminded of our guilty conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:36.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that ransom was being demanded for hiding\Nthe secret behind our micromachines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And then, a killer virus later made its way\Ninto your micromachines in another incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:49.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes. In addition to being angry at myself, who felt\Nelated upon approval of the micromachine treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:51.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I cursed you from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:54.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought, "This is just corporate terrorism,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:57.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but it wasn't by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:04.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The evil that lurks in this world exists to a\Nfar greater extent than we can possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You must know about the fact that public\Nfunds were used to aid corporations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:15.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that were forced to the brink of\Nbankruptcy by the killer virus terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will tell you about what\Ntranspired after that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the same time as our stocks began\Nto recover from hitting rock-bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:30.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a man claiming to be a member of a certain representative's\Nprivate support organisation appeared before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:34.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He said that he knew someone who could\Nput an end to corporate terrorism
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:38.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and asked us to contribute\Nfunding to the representative
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,in the event that an end to\Nthe crimes was duly announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The presented amount was the\Nsum of the public funding we
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,received and the ransom money\Nthat was previously demanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There was nothing to be surprised about;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:56.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,as a latecomer in the industry, we were targeted\Nfor corporate terrorism from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words, what I did was a truly\Nconvenient performance for those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:03.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That seems to have been the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:10.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By mimicking what you did, they created an\Nillusory figure called the Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And by intermittently suggesting the\Npresence of a nonexistent criminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,they manipulated stock prices and stole\Nmoney from other corporations as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:19.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even before all of this happened,\NI'm sure that they pocketed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:22.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a considerable amount of\Nprofit by short selling stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:25.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was that representative the current\NSecretary General Yakushima?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:35.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, hackers originally existed for the\Nsole purpose of peeking at things that are hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:40.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, after being defeated by the depths of evil that\NI saw in the abode of the demons I sought to challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:45.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I also had no choice but to avert my eyes from everything and\Nmaintain silence while turning a deaf ear to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:48.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just as you have done for the past six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:55.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"The Laughing Man"...\Nan ingenious nickname, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:21:02.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was only trying to quote Holden's words and\Nintended to disappear if I failed to persuade you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:06.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but now it's merely a connection\Nwith Salinger... geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:11.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Say, Serrano-San, if that's what they have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then I must become the original Laughing Man\Nand expose their fraud to the light of day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:19.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have also made my decision,\Nnow that I have been able to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While there is little evidence to successfully indict\Nhim, I will become one of your mimickers and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:35.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please stay alive until you\Nappear on the witness stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:37.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Squad Two in position!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Squad Three in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Squad Four in position!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:46.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All squads are now in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Building's security systems\Nare now under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:49.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:51.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No changes perceived in targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:52.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:53.49,Default - Copy,,0,900,750,,{\b1\i1}GOODS ENTRANCE{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:10.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:13.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Secured target B.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no sign of target A.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:20.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:27.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was quite some acting you did there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:31.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With that, you could steal anyone's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've never been in any school plays, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:45.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You were able to find the connection between\NSERANO and that Yakushima guy, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:46.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:49.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the Laughing Man told me was true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:52.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With this, Mr. SERANO must\Nhave hardened his resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:54.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,900,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.16,Default,,0,0,900,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.68,Default,,0,0,900,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Default,,0,0,900,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Default,,0,0,900,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.77,Default,,0,0,900,,And is she really human?
